[{"title":"湘江渔父词四绝 其一","author":"张吉","text":"扁舟来往小滩间，占断清湘一两湾。\n日午风轻鱼自乐，相看不厌任罾閒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50643,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘江渔父词四绝 其二","author":"张吉","text":"世业从来只小舟，相传一味是无忧。\n烟消灶底鱼初熟，台笠蒙头粥半瓯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50644,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘江渔父词四绝 其三","author":"张吉","text":"郎今送客下平川，更卖肥鲜了课钱。\n老去独便多自在，惯依丛蓧枕罾眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50645,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"湘江渔父词四绝 其四","author":"张吉","text":"柳花飘尽荻芽长，艇艇鱼苗有数筐。\n日晚江光看渐远，贩儿灯火下潇湘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50646,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵娄诚善春日楼居四绝 其一","author":"张吉","text":"匹马寻春到瓮城，城中春色自分明。\n半空丝竹轰清昼，绕榻晴云阁鸟声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50647,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵娄诚善春日楼居四绝 其二","author":"张吉","text":"春事俄惊欲尽头，强舒眉宇此登楼。\n笑谈唤醒幽人梦，共倚檐花看水流。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50648,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵娄诚善春日楼居四绝 其三","author":"张吉","text":"三月看春尚未齐，楼中聊共片云栖。\n欲知深暝无言处，众鸟飞来寂不啼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50649,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵娄诚善春日楼居四绝 其四","author":"张吉","text":"伯子移舟向古陂，晚漪觞我不嫌迟。\n小楼独下湘帘坐，也到斜阳半壁儿。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50650,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送段储使元六官满北归","author":"张吉","text":"我兄行派子相同，见子思兄意万重。\n骨肉千金官一羽，萍蓬深愧谩西东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50651,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生见寄葵山之作三绝 其一","author":"张吉","text":"乾坤独放几人閒，一曲高歌又此山。\n脚底秋云三十丈，不知朝去暮来还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50652,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生见寄葵山之作三绝 其二","author":"张吉","text":"何人忙里会偷閒，是处江天是处山。\n满袖茶烟吹不散，瘦筇前日古劳还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50653,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵白沙先生见寄葵山之作三绝 其三","author":"张吉","text":"浮世劳劳更甚閒，丹阳人已到葵山。\n草鞋不带红尘气，换得神仙两舄还。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":50654,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"吕仙亭饯邹宗道赴京二绝 其一","author":"张吉","text":"故人别家游河朔，莫厌山高尊酒